<text x="42" y="86" font-family="Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="400" fill="#465b72">PostgreSQL  /  AsociaciÃ³n de usuarios y roles N:M</text>
<rect x="42" y="120" width="292" height="270" rx="15" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#a6b9ca" stroke-width="1.5"/>
