<text x="64" y="258" font-family="Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="400" fill="#15243b">username, email Â· Ãºnicos</text>
<text x="64" y="291" font-family="Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="400" fill="#15243b">password_hash</text>
